<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CWK1 Frontend - Alumni Portal</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .message {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .code-block {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #333;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: #ddd;
            color: #333;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #ccc;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .container {
                padding: 30px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .code-block {
                font-size: 11px;
            }

            .btn, .btn-secondary {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                margin-top: 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>CWK1 Alumni Portal</h1>
        <p class="message">
            The frontend for CWK1 alumni profile management has not yet been implemented.
        </p>
        <p class="message">
            To manage your profile (degrees, certifications, licenses, courses, and employment history), please use Postman or any API client:
        </p>
        
        <div class="code-block">
            POST /cwk1/profile/create<br>
            GET /cwk1/profile/:id<br>
            PUT /cwk1/profile/:id<br>
            DELETE /cwk1/profile/:id
        </div>

        <p class="message" style="font-style: italic; color: #999;">
            Base URL: http://localhost:3001
        </p>

        <div>
            <form method="GET" action="/account/login" style="display: inline;">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Login</button>
            </form>
            <form method="GET" action="/account/signup" style="display: inline;">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Create New Account</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
